{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Planarity"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PlanarEmbedding"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PlanarEmbedding"}],"title":"PlanarEmbedding","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:9Planarity15PlanarEmbeddingV","symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding.swift#L66","fileName":"PlanarEmbedding.swift"}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PlanarEmbedding","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","text":"Graph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A self-loop appears twice in its vertex’s order, its two ends adjacent, enclosing a face of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"length 1. Parallel copies sit side by side, each consecutive pair enclosing a face of length 2.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each clockwise order starts at the first edge of ","type":"text"},{"code":"incidentEdges(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]